       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Improved in-combat partner AI, increased the frequency of skill releases for partner, and prevented it from moving randomly when not in combat;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Adjusted the curve for HP and damage, resulting in a smoother early-game development.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gratesca Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "19th December, 2023",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
